  "brain_first": "“不要先想后缀，先确定空位必须是什么词性。”",
  "sort_order": 1054,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "RECOGNISE - How it usually looks",
      "sourcePage": 83,
      "sourceIndex": 2293
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "括号给一个词根，句子需要另一词性，如 success",
      "sourcePage": 83,
      "sourceIndex": 2294
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "→ successful → successfully。",
      "sourcePage": 83,
      "sourceIndex": 2295
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "TERM - What the term really means",
      "sourcePage": 83,
      "sourceIndex": 2296
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Word formation：通过前后缀改变词性或意义。",
      "sourcePage": 83,
      "sourceIndex": 2297
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "THINK - First sentence in your head: “不要先想后缀，先确定空位必须是什么词性。”",
      "sourcePage": 83,
      "sourceIndex": 2298
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "WHY - Why this works: 高频考法稳定，尤其 noun/adjective/adverb 互转。",
      "sourcePage": 83,
      "sourceIndex": 2299
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STEPS - Follow this route",
      "sourcePage": 83,
      "sourceIndex": 2300
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "1 先用句子位置判断目标词性。",
      "sourcePage": 83,
      "sourceIndex": 2301
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "2 再从词根生成目标形式。",
      "sourcePage": 83,
      "sourceIndex": 2302
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "3 检查是否需要否定前缀 un-/in-/im-/dis-。",
      "sourcePage": 83,
      "sourceIndex": 2303
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "4 检查拼写变化：happy→happiness，possible→possibility。",
      "sourcePage": 83,
      "sourceIndex": 2304
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "✏ 草稿纸上具体写什么： 空格前后各画一条短线；标 pronoun? / contrast? / cause? / example?；两个",
      "sourcePage": 83,
      "sourceIndex": 2305
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "纠结选项写 A/B 再逐条验指代与逻辑。",
      "sourcePage": 83,
      "sourceIndex": 2306
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "IF/THEN - If... then...",
      "sourcePage": 83,
      "sourceIndex": 2307
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· -tion/-ment/-ness/-ity → 常名词",
      "sourcePage": 83,
      "sourceIndex": 2308
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· -ful/-less/-ive/-al/-ous → 常形容词",
      "sourcePage": 83,
      "sourceIndex": 2309
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· -ly → 常副词，但 friendly/lovely 是形容词",
      "sourcePage": 83,
      "sourceIndex": 2310
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STOP - Stop when: 目标词性、词义方向和拼写都正确。",
      "sourcePage": 83,
      "sourceIndex": 2311
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STUCK - If you are stuck: 想不起词形时先读整句判断“需要一个什么概念”，再回忆最常见派生。",
      "sourcePage": 83,
      "sourceIndex": 2312
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "EXAMPLE - Worked example",
      "sourcePage": 83,
      "sourceIndex": 2313
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Her explanation was clear and ___ (effect). be + adjective → effective。",
      "sourcePage": 83,
      "sourceIndex": 2314
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "TRAPS - Common traps",
      "sourcePage": 84,
      "sourceIndex": 2315
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 盲目加 -ly。",
      "sourcePage": 84,
      "sourceIndex": 2316
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 忘记否定含义。",
      "sourcePage": 84,
      "sourceIndex": 2317
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "CHECK - Final check",
      "sourcePage": 84,
      "sourceIndex": 2318
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 词性对？",
      "sourcePage": 84,
      "sourceIndex": 2319
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 正负意义对？",
      "sourcePage": 84,
      "sourceIndex": 2320
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 拼写变化对？",
      "sourcePage": 84,
      "sourceIndex": 2321
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "🔧 纠错动作： 做完不要只对答案，先给错误归类。错误代码： 7-P 代词指代｜7-L 逻辑关系｜7-T 主题链",
      "sourcePage": 84,
      "sourceIndex": 2322
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "｜7-O 位置不合理｜7-R 内容重复。",
      "sourcePage": 84,
      "sourceIndex": 2323
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "同一种错误连续出现2次 → 在对应代码旁画★，下次做题先检查这一项。",
      "sourcePage": 84,
      "sourceIndex": 2324
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "MEMORY - 30-second memory: 构词先定词性，后找后缀。",
      "sourcePage": 84,
      "sourceIndex": 2325
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "可选巩固｜5题（查完SOP后再做）",
      "sourcePage": 84,
      "sourceIndex": 2327
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "1. develop→名词",
      "sourcePage": 84,
      "sourceIndex": 2328
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "2. possible→名词",
      "sourcePage": 84,
      "sourceIndex": 2329
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "3. careful→副词",
      "sourcePage": 84,
      "sourceIndex": 2330
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "4. agree→否定",
      "sourcePage": 84,
      "sourceIndex": 2331
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "5. true→副词",
      "sourcePage": 84,
      "sourceIndex": 2332
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "答案速查：1. development；2. possibility；3. carefully；4. disagree；5. truly",
      "sourcePage": 84,
      "sourceIndex": 2333
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "— GF6 本题型到这里。下次卡住直接 Ctrl+F 搜“GF6”或题型关键词。—",
